      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_17",
      "hash64": "AA174AEB935D3067",
      "text": "1份10000，\\n你愿意捐款吗？[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_18",
      "hash64": "AA173FEB935D1DB6",
      "text": "哇！10份100000，\\n你真的愿意捐这么多吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_19",
      "hash64": "AA1740EB935D1F69",
      "text": "目标是1000000！\\n我随时都等候你来哦。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_20",
      "hash64": "AA13C1EB935A11C5",
      "text": "你的钱好像不够捐款呢……[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_21",
      "hash64": "AA13C0EB935A1012",
      "text": "那我就心怀感激地收下咯！\\n不介意的话，这个就给你吧。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_015_caretaker_22",
      "hash64": "AA13BFEB935A0E5F",
      "text": "目标金额是1000000！\\n目前已募集到[VAR 0x0206(0001,0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
